@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix oc: <https://example.org/bask-223p/v2#> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.org/fdd/validation/> .
<https://example.org/fdd/validation/base> a owl:Ontology .
ex:ImportedPointShape a sh:NodeShape ; sh:targetClass oc:Point ;
  sh:property [sh:path oc:pointName ; sh:minCount 1] .
